{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>You shall not surrender a slave to his master.</b> This master is not an Israelite, and this slave fled from outside the Land to the Land, and it is forbidden to surrender him into the hand of his master who is outside the Land; and this is because of the belovedness of the Land. And we compel his master to write him a bill of manumission and release him in Israel, and the slave writes him a document for his value."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:50:33.812757118Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}